{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-55-1","title":"Isaiah 55:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet, with the promises of Christ, calls to faith, 6 and to repentance. 8 The happy success of them that believe.</p>\n<p>Ho. Ru 4:1; Pr 1:21-23; 8:4; Zec 2:6 every. 41:17,18; Ps 42:1,2; 63:1; 143:6; Joh 4:10-14; 7:37,38; Re 21:6 Re 22:1,17 buy, and. Mt 13:44; Re 3:18 buy wine. So 1:2,4; 5:1; Zec 9:15; 10:7; Mt 26:29; Joh 2:3-10 milk. Joe 3:18; 1Co 3:2; 1Pe 2:2 without money. 52:3; Ro 3:24; Eph 2:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-2","title":"Isaiah 55:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>do ye. 44:20; Jer 2:13; Ho 8:7; 12:1; Hab 2:13; Mt 15:9; Lu 15:15,16 Ro 9:31; 10:2,3; Php 3:4-7; Heb 13:9 spend. Heb. weigh. 46:6 Hearken. 51:1,4,7; Ex 15:26; De 11:13; Ps 34:11; Pr 1:33; 7:23; 8:32; Mr 7:14 Ro 10:17 eat. 25:6; Ps 22:26; 36:8; 63:5; Pr 9:5; Jer 31:14; Mt 22:4; Lu 15:23 Joh 6:48-58</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-3","title":"Isaiah 55:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Incline. Ps 78:1; 119:112; Pr 4:20 come. Mt 11:28; Joh 6:37,44,45; 7:37 hear. Mt 13:16; 17:5; Joh 5:24,25; 8:47; 10:27 and I will. 54:8; 61:8; Ge 17:7; 2Sa 23:5; Jer 32:40; 50:5; Heb 13:20 the sure. 2Sa 7:8-17; Ps 89:28,35-37; Jer 33:20,21,26; Eze 37:24,25 Ac 13:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-4","title":"Isaiah 55:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I have. Joh 3:16; 18:37; 1Ti 6:13; Re 1:5; 3:14 a leader. 49:8-10; Ps 2:6; Jer 30:9; Eze 34:23,24; Da 9:25; Ho 3:5; Mic 5:2-4 Mt 2:6; 28:18-20; Joh 10:3,27; 12:26; 13:13; 2Th 1:8; Eph 5:24 Heb 2:10; 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-5","title":"Isaiah 55:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>thou shalt. 11:10,11; 52:15; 56:8; Ge 49:10; Ps 18:43; Ro 15:20; Eph 2:11; 3:5 nations. 60:5; Ho 1:10; Zec 2:11; 8:20-23 he. 60:9; Ps 110:1-3; Lu 24:26; Joh 13:31,32; 17:1; Ac 3:13; 5:31 Heb 5:5; 1Pe 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-6","title":"Isaiah 55:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Seek. 45:19; 1Ch 28:9; 2Ch 19:3; Job 8:5; Ps 14:2; 27:8; 32:6; 95:7 Jer 29:12-14; Am 5:6; Mt 5:25; 7:7,8; 25:11,12; Lu 13:25 Joh 7:33,34; 8:21; 12:35,36; 2Co 6:1,2; Heb 2:3; 3:13 while he is near. 12:6; 46:13; De 4:7; Ps 75:1; 145:18; 148:14; Eze 8:6; Eph 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-7","title":"Isaiah 55:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the wicked. 1:16-18; 2Ch 7:14; Pr 28:13; Jer 3:3; 8:4-6; Eze 3:18,19 Eze 18:21-23,27-32; 33:11,14-16; Ho 14:1,2; Jon 3:10; Mt 9:13 Lu 15:10,24; Ac 3:19; 26:20; 1Co 6:9-11; Jas 4:8-10 unrighteous man. Heb. man of iniquity. his thoughts. Ge 6:5; Ps 66:18; Jer 4:14; Zec 8:17; Mt 15:18,19; 23:25,26 Mr 7:21,23; Lu 11:39,40; Ac 8:21,22; Jas 1:15 for. 43:25; 44:22; Ex 34:6,7; Nu 14:18,19; Ps 51:1; 130:7; Jer 3:12,13 Lu 7:47; Ro 5:16-21; Eph 1:6-8; 1Ti 1:15,16 abundantly. Heb. multiply to.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-8","title":"Isaiah 55:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>2Sa 7:19; Ps 25:10; 40:5; 92:5; Pr 21:8; 25:3; Jer 3:1; Eze 18:29 Da 4:37; Ho 14:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-9","title":"Isaiah 55:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Ps 36:5; 77:19; 89:2; 103:11; Mt 11:25; Ro 11:31-36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-10","title":"Isaiah 55:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>as the rain. 5:6; 30:23; 61:11; De 32:2; 1Sa 23:4; Ps 65:9-13; 72:6,7; Eze 34:26 Ho 10:12; Re 11:6 give. 2Co 9:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-11","title":"Isaiah 55:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>shall my. 54:9; De 32:2; Mt 24:35; Lu 8:11-16; Joh 6:63; Ro 10:17; 1Co 1:18 1Co 3:6-9; 1Th 2:13; Heb 6:7; Jas 1:18; 1Pe 1:23 it shall accomplish. 44:26-28; 45:23; 46:10; Eph 1:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-12","title":"Isaiah 55:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>ye shall. 35:10; 48:20; 49:9,10; 51:11; 65:13,14; Ps 105:43; Jer 30:19 Jer 31:12-14; 33:6,11; Zec 2:7-10; Ro 5:1,11; 15:13; Ga 5:22 Col 1:11 the mountains. 14:8; 35:1,2; 42:10,11; 44:23; 49:13; Ps 65:13; 96:11-13; 98:7-9 Ps 148:4-13; Lu 15:10; Re 19:1-6 clap. 1Ch 16:32,33; Ps 47:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-55-13","title":"Isaiah 55:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":55,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":55,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>of the thorn. 11:6-9; 41:19; 60:13,21; 61:3; Mic 7:4; Ro 6:19; 1Co 6:9-11 2Co 5:17 for a. 43:21; Jer 13:11; 33:9; Lu 2:14; Joh 15:8; Eph 3:20,21; 1Pe 2:9,10 1Pe 4:11 an everlasting. 54:10; Jer 50:5</p>"}]}